  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Criminal Behavior Associations",
  "description": "The phrase 'nibber get' is a derogatory racial slur targeting Black people, implying criminal behavior. This stereotype is part of a broader historical and systemic pattern of associating Black individuals with crime, which is used in the meme to mock the 'stand your ground' law by linking it to a racially charged, offensive phrase.",
